 "c": [
  {"i":1952,"t":["actions","hobbies"],"n":"Learners meet 活動 mostly as クラブ活動, 部活動 and volunteer work, which are free-time contexts. A work unit is a weak fit."},
  {"i":1972,"t":["nature"],"n":"The ground or earth's surface is a nature word. A position link is only a loose association."},
  {"i":1974,"t":["communication"],"s":{"3":["relationships"]},"n":"Being called or summoned is communication. Being invited is social contact. Festivals is too loose."},
  {"i":2006,"t":["feelings"],"s":{"2":["business"]},"n":"The main sense is feeling down. The slump sense (売上が落ち込む) is common at intermediate level and belongs to business."},
  {"i":2036,"t":["school","people"],"s":{"4":["law"],"5":["measures"]},"n":"組 means a class or a group of people. The crime-syndicate sense is law. 一組 and 二組 as a counter for sets and pairs belong with counters."}
 ],
 "d": [
  {"i":1951,"keep":[4,6],"n":"Pressing someone with questions and the tsukkomi retort are both common spoken senses that belong under communication."},
  {"i":1953,"keep":[3,5],"n":"Defeating an opponent is common in sports; breaking a promise or rule (約束/規則を破る) is a core sense for rules."},
  {"i":1955,"keep":[3],"n":"Solving a problem (問題を解く) is a core sense, taught with school work and thinking."},
  {"i":1958,"keep":[],"n":"Learners know 告白 mainly as a love confession; confessing a crime is usually 自白, so the law sense is marginal."},
  {"i":1968,"keep":[1],"n":"The emergency sense is very common (非常口, 非常時) and fits the emergencies part of law."},
  {"i":1974,"keep":[3],"n":"Being invited (結婚式に呼ばれる) is a common sense and belongs to social contact."},
  {"i":1978,"keep":[2],"n":"偉い人 for a high-ranking person or boss is very common and is taught with work and hierarchy."},
  {"i":1982,"keep":[],"n":"お疲れ is taught as a set phrase; plain tiredness is taught with 疲れ, not this word."},
  {"i":2003,"keep":[2],"n":"The counter use (三種類) is common and belongs to measures."},
  {"i":2006,"keep":[2],"n":"An economic slump (売り上げが落ち込む) is a common news usage and fits business."},
  {"i":2021,"keep":[3],"n":"Playing a wind instrument (笛を吹く) is common and is taught with music."},
  {"i":2025,"keep":[2],"n":"身内に不幸があった as a euphemism for death is common and is taught with family and funeral customs."},
  {"i":2036,"keep":[5],"n":"一組 as a set or pair counter is common; the crime-syndicate sense is not learner-level."},
  {"i":2038,"keep":[],"n":"The spatial sense is rare; 直前 is overwhelmingly temporal."},
  {"i":2049,"keep":[4],"n":"Turning at a corner (右に折れる) is common when giving directions."},
  {"i":2058,"keep":[4],"n":"式 as an equation is common in maths class; the -style sense (和式) does not really belong to qualities."},
  {"i":2098,"keep":[3],"n":"Height (背が高い) is a core sense, taught when describing how people look."},
  {"i":2100,"keep":[2],"n":"Reading someone's expression (顔色をうかがう) is a common sense that belongs to feelings."}
 ]
